10\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-yellow-400 mb-2\">Limited Time Offer</h3><div class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">30% OFF <span class=\"text-2xl text-red-200 block\">VIP Plans</span></div><p class=\"text-red-100 mb-6\">Use code <span class=\"font-mono bg-red-800 px-2 py-1 rounded text-yellow-300 font-bold\">CNY30</span> at checkout. Valid for all VIP trip packages until Feb 15th.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 mb-8 text-red-100\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-yellow-400\">✓</span> Advanced AI Personalization</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-yellow-400\">✓</span> Export to Google Maps</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-yellow-400\">✓</span> Priority Support</li></ul><a href=\"/#pricing\" class=\"text-yellow-400 font-bold hover:text-yellow-300 flex items-center gap-1\">Claim Offer <span>→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"bg-red-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-red-700 p-8 rounded-3xl relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-yellow-400/50 transition\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition\"><span class=\"text-9xl text-yellow-500 transform -rotate-12 block\">🎁</span></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-yellow-400 mb-2\">Creator Giveaway</h3><div class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">FREE <span class=\"text-2xl text-red-200 block\">VIP Access</span></div><p class=\"text-red-100 mb-6\">Are you a travel vlogger or influencer? We\"re giving away 50 VIP passes to creators who want to showcase Indonesia.</p><div class=\"bg-red-800/50 p-4 rounded-xl mb-6 border border-red-700\"><p class=\"text-sm text-red-200\"><span class=\"font-bold text-yellow-400\">How to enter:</span> Share your favorite Indonesian destination on Instagram/TikTok, tag @itinara_ai, and use hashtag #ItinaraCNY.</p></div><a href=\"https://instagram.com/itinara_ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-yellow-400 font-bold hover:text-yellow-300 flex items-center gap-1\">Visit Instagram <span>→</span></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center pb-10 text-red-300 text-sm\">Terms and conditions apply. Promotion ends Feb 15, 2026.</div></div>"
